^CONVERSION ERROR$
A variadic constructor with a pack expansion in a function-call-expression
initializer and with two-or-more-element packs.  Two gaps remain: the empty
pack in the function-call-expression initializer is not collapsed so the
constructor body is left bodyless, and a non-empty pack of two or more elements
is not expanded to one parameter per element.  The base-mem-init empty-pack
pattern is handled separately and verified by cpp11_variadic_ctor_pack.  Flip
to CORE once function-call-expression empty-pack collapse and multi-element
pack expansion are implemented.
